        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="schema-notes" value="SCHEMA NOTES&#10;&#10;PK = primary key   ·   FK = foreign key   ·   UK = unique key&#10;products.seller_id → sellers.id: ON DELETE RESTRICT; indexed for seller filtering.&#10;Delete a seller’s products before deleting the seller.&#10;Emails are lowercase and unique per table; names must be nonblank.&#10;Stock defaults to 0. Creation/applied timestamps are NOT NULL and default to now().&#10;Fields are NOT NULL unless marked nullable; empty-text defaults are empty strings.&#10;Authentication and admin remain next-sprint work." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fillColor=#F2F6FA;strokeColor=#DCE4EE;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#20334A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440" y="550" width="910" height="214" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
